To perform hybrid retrieval using BM25 and vector search in VINOX, you can use the `vinox.search` function. Here's how you would typically set up such an operation:

```json
{
    "function": "vinox.search",
    "arguments": {
        "limit": 10,
        "query": "hybrid retrieval bm25"
    }
}
```

This JSON structure specifies that we want to retrieve up to 10 documents (`limit`) based on the phrase "hybrid retrieval" combined with "bm25". The actual implementation might require additional parameters depending on specific requirements or configurations from the VINOX library.
